<title>USA: Randalls Food Markets sells $150 mln in junk bonds.</title>
<headline>Randalls Food Markets sells $150 mln in junk bonds.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following 144a private placement of debt from Randall's Food Markets Inc was priced Tuesday via lead manager BT Securities Corp, according to market sources.</p>
<p>BORROWER RANDALL'S FOOD MARKETS INC</p>
<p>AMT $150 MLN	 COUPON 9.375 PCT  MATURITY 7/1/07</p>
<p>TYPE SR NOTES	ISS PRICE 99.837  FIRST PAY DATE 1/1/98</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S B2    YIELD 9.40 PCT    PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P B-MINUS   SPREAD +300 BPS   CALLABLE NON-CALL FIVE</p>
<p>NOTES: THREE-YEAR EQUITY CALL FOR 40 PERCENT OF THE ISSUE AT 109.375 PERCENT.</p>
<p>((U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212-859-1662))</p>
</text>
